        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml E-Commerce Checkout System\n\n&#39; Change direction from Top-to-Bottom to Left-to-Right\nleft to right direction\n\n&#39; Style configuration (Optional)\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\n\n&#39; Define Actors\nactor \&quot;Customer\&quot; as customer\nactor \&quot;Premium Customer\&quot; as vip\nactor \&quot;Payment Gateway\&quot; as gateway &lt;&lt;Service&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Actor Generalization (VIP Customer inherits from normal Customer)\ncustomer &lt;|-- vip\n\n&#39; System Boundary\nrectangle \&quot;E-Commerce Checkout System\&quot; {\n    \n    &#39; Define Use Cases\n    usecase \&quot;Place Order\&quot; as UC_place\n    usecase \&quot;View Order History\&quot; as UC_history\n    usecase \&quot;Process Payment\&quot; as UC_payment\n    usecase \&quot;Validate Customer Details\&quot; as UC_validate\n    usecase \&quot;Apply Coupon Code\&quot; as UC_coupon\n    \n    &#39; Associations (Actors to Use Cases)\n    customer --&gt; UC_place\n    customer --&gt; UC_history\n    \n    &#39; Structural Inclusions (Mandatory behaviors)\n    UC_place ..&gt; UC_validate : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    UC_place ..&gt; UC_payment : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n    \n    &#39; Extensions (Optional behaviors)\n    UC_coupon ..&gt; UC_place : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n    \n    &#39; External System Interactions\n    UC_payment --&gt; gateway\n}\n\n&#39; Individual Note Example\nnote right of vip : Enjoys automatic free shipping\\non checkout.\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="HCB2PgWAqnKDadzJ3f-A-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
