        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml User Authentication Sequence\n\n&#39; Configuration for clean styling\nskinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true\nautonumber \&quot;&lt;b&gt;[00]&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;\n\n&#39; Define Participants\nactor \&quot;User\&quot; as user\nparticipant \&quot;Frontend UI\&quot; as ui\ndatabase \&quot;Auth Service\&quot; as auth\nentity \&quot;MFA Provider\&quot; as mfa\n\n&#39; Execution Flow\nuser -&gt; ui : Enter Credentials (User/Pass)\nactivate ui\n\nui -&gt; auth : Request Authentication (POST /login)\nactivate auth\n\nauth -&gt; auth : Verify Password Hash\n\nalt Credentials Invalid\n    auth --&gt; ui : HTTP 401 Unauthorized\n    ui --&gt; user : Show \&quot;Invalid Credentials\&quot; Error\nelse Credentials Valid\n    auth -&gt; mfa : Generate &amp; Send OTP Request\n    activate mfa\n    mfa -&gt; user : Send SMS / Push Notification\n    mfa --&gt; auth : OTP Pending Confirmation\n    deactivate mfa\n    \n    auth --&gt; ui : HTTP 202 (MFA Required)\n    ui --&gt; user : Prompt for 6-Digit OTP Code\n    deactivate ui\n    \n    &#39; Loop for OTP Retries (Max 3 times)\n    loop Up to 3 Verification Attempts\n        user -&gt; ui : Submit OTP Code\n        activate ui\n        ui -&gt; auth : Verify OTP (POST /verify)\n        \n        alt OTP Match Success\n            auth --&gt; ui : HTTP 200 OK (JWT Access Token)\n            ui --&gt; user : Redirect to Dashboard\n        else OTP Mismatch\n            auth --&gt; ui : HTTP 400 Bad Request (Invalid OTP)\n            ui --&gt; user : Show \&quot;Incorrect Code\&quot; Warning\n            deactivate ui\n        end\n    end\n    \n    deactivate auth\nend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="HCB2PgWAqnKDadzJ3f-A-24">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
